  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Open Vrchat 2. Play and join friends on worlds 3. Crash\n\nI have almost no storage missing I only have two games yet no memory? Why is this?\n\nI've tried to clear my data and cache, yet I still can't join worlds or even my home world so I don't know",
